---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Emergency Car Lockout Service in Delaware | Locked Out of Car | 1st Capital Locksmith"
  description="Keys locked in your car in Delaware? 1st Capital Locksmith provides fast, damage-free emergency car lockout service across Dover, Smyrna, Milford, and all of Kent County. Available 6 Days a Week — call (302) 735-0050."
>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-3">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 flex-wrap">
        <li>
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Home</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
          <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Services</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold">Emergency Car Lockout</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Schema: Breadcrumbs -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Services", "item": "https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com/services/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Emergency Car Lockout", "item": "https://1stcapitallocksmithde.com/services/emergency-car-lockout/" }
    ]
  })} />

  <!-- Schema: Service -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "Emergency Car Lockout Service in Delaware",
    "description": "Professional emergency car lockout service throughout Delaware. 1st Capital Locksmith opens locked vehicles for all makes and models using damage-free automotive entry tools. Fast fast dispatch across Kent County.",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "1st Capital Locksmith",
      "telephone": "+13027350050",
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "addressLocality": "Dover",
        "addressRegion": "DE",
        "addressCountry": "US"
      }
    },
    "areaServed": {
      "@type": "State",
      "name": "Delaware"
    },
    "serviceType": "Emergency Car Lockout Service"
  })} />

  <!-- Schema: FAQ -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How fast can you reach me for a car lockout in Delaware?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "For most locations in Kent County, we arrive within 20–30 minutes of your call. We dispatch immediately and will give you an estimated arrival time when you call. Call (302) 735-0050 and we will head your way."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Will you damage my car opening it?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. We use professional automotive entry tools including slim jim tools, long reach equipment, and air wedge systems specifically designed for damage-free vehicle entry. We take great care with your door seals and weather stripping. In virtually all cases your vehicle is fully unaffected after entry."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you open any type of vehicle?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We can open the vast majority of passenger vehicles including sedans, SUVs, trucks, minivans, and most commercial vans. We carry tools suited for a wide range of makes and models. If you have a specialty or older vehicle, mention it when you call and we will confirm compatibility."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What if my key broke inside the car door or ignition?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We handle broken key extraction for both door locks and ignition cylinders. Our technicians carry specialized extraction tools to remove key fragments without damaging the lock or ignition. After extraction, if you need a new key cut, we can often do that on the same visit."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you make me a new car key on the spot?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "In many cases, yes. We carry key cutting equipment for standard and transponder keys and can cut and program replacement keys for many popular makes and models. Call us to confirm whether we can handle your specific vehicle on-site."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What if there is a child or pet locked in my car?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "If a child or pet is locked in a car — especially in hot weather — call 911 immediately, then call us. Emergency services can respond faster in life-safety situations. We support emergency responders and can follow up for vehicle security after the immediate situation is resolved."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is emergency car lockout available at night and on weekends?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. We provide emergency car lockout service throughout Delaware including nights, weekends, and holidays. We are open 6 days a week."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Where in Delaware do you provide car lockout service?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We serve all of Kent County and surrounding areas including Dover, Smyrna, Milford, Camden, Harrington, Felton, Wyoming, Frederica, Magnolia, Clayton, and all surrounding communities. Call us wherever you are and we will get there fast."
        }
      }
    ]
  })} />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section
    class="relative min-h-[340px] md:min-h-[500px] flex items-center text-white py-10 md:py-20"
    style="background-image: url('/images/emergency-car-lockout.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/72"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-6 z-10">
      <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-xs md:text-sm mb-2 md:mb-4">Emergency Car Lockout — Delaware</p>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-3 md:mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-tight">
        Emergency Car Lockout Service in Delaware — Keys Locked In? We Are On the Way.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm md:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-5 md:mb-8">
        Locked out of your vehicle in Delaware? 1st Capital Locksmith provides fast, damage-free emergency car lockout service for all makes and models across Kent County. Available 6 Days a Week — call now and a technician is dispatched immediately.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 md:gap-4">
        <a
          href="tel:3027350050"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-white font-bold text-base md:text-lg hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
        >
          Call (302) 735-0050
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-white font-semibold text-sm md:text-base hover:bg-white hover:text-[#1A1F22] transition"
        >
          Get Help Now
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust Bar -->
  <section class="bg-[#0E1B2F] py-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Available 6 Days a Week</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Nights, Weekends & Holidays</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">All Makes & Models</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Sedans, SUVs, Trucks & Vans</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Damage-Free Entry</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Professional Automotive Tools</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Fast Dispatch</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">20–30 Min Across Kent County</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Delaware's Car Lockout Specialists</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6 leading-snug">
            Professional Emergency Car Lockout Service Across Delaware
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Getting locked out of your car is one of the most frustrating and disruptive experiences on the road — especially when it happens far from home, in an unfamiliar area, or in bad weather. 1st Capital Locksmith responds to emergency car lockouts throughout Delaware with fast dispatch and professional, non-damaging entry techniques for all vehicle types.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Our automotive lockout technicians use slim jim tools, long reach equipment, and precision air wedge systems to open modern vehicles without touching the door seals, weather stripping, or locking mechanisms. These tools are specifically designed for the geometry of modern car doors and ensure your vehicle looks and functions exactly as it did before the lockout.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We serve drivers throughout <a href="/service-areas/dover-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Dover</a>, <a href="/service-areas/smyrna-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Smyrna</a>, <a href="/service-areas/milford-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Milford</a>, <a href="/service-areas/harrington-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Harrington</a>, <a href="/service-areas/camden-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Camden</a>, <a href="/service-areas/felton-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Felton</a>, and all surrounding Kent County communities. Call (302) 735-0050 any time — we are available 6 days a week.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-[#F8F8F5] aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="/images/emergency-car-lockout-service.jpg"
              alt="Emergency car lockout service in Delaware"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="600"
              height="450"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6">Common Car Lockout Situations We Handle:</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {[
                "Keys Left on Seat or in Cupholder",
                "Keys Locked in Trunk",
                "Key Left in Ignition (Car Locked)",
                "Key Fob Battery Dead — Car Won't Open",
                "Key Broken Off in Door Lock",
                "Key Broken Off in Ignition",
                "Power Door Lock Failure",
                "Child or Pet Locked Inside",
                "Lockout in Parking Lot or Remote Area",
                "After-Hours & Holiday Vehicle Lockout",
              ].map((item) => (
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-700">
                  <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
              <a
                href="tel:3027350050"
                class="w-full inline-flex justify-center items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 text-white font-bold hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
              >
                Call (302) 735-0050 Now
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Types Detail -->
  <section id="services" class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Automotive Lockout Expertise</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Emergency Car Lockout Services We Provide</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          From a standard lockout to broken key extraction and replacement key cutting, our automotive locksmiths handle every car lock situation throughout Delaware.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m3 0h6m-9 0H3.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V14.25m17.25 4.5a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m3 0h1.125c.621 0 1.129-.504 1.09-1.124a17.902 17.902 0 00-3.213-9.193 2.056 2.056 0 00-1.58-.86H14.25M16.5 18.75h-2.25m0-11.177v-.958c0-.568-.422-1.048-.987-1.106a48.554 48.554 0 00-10.026 0 1.106 1.106 0 00-.987 1.106v7.635m12-6.677v6.677m0 4.5v-4.5m0 0h-12" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Standard Vehicle Lockout Entry</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            The most common car lockout scenario — keys left on the seat, in the cupholder, or in the trunk while the door locked behind you. This is the situation we handle dozens of times each week across Delaware, and our technicians can open most vehicles quickly and cleanly.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We use air wedge systems to create a small, controlled gap at the top corner of the door frame, then insert a long reach tool to manipulate the interior unlock button or handle. This method is standard in the industry and does not damage door seals or weather stripping when performed correctly.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            After we open your vehicle, if you have concerns about key security, we offer <a href="/services/car-key-replacement/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">car key replacement</a> on the same visit for many popular makes and models.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.42 15.17L17.25 21A2.652 2.652 0 0021 17.25l-5.877-5.877M11.42 15.17l2.496-3.03c.317-.384.74-.626 1.208-.766M11.42 15.17l-4.655 5.653a2.548 2.548 0 11-3.586-3.586l6.837-5.63m5.108-.233c.55-.164 1.163-.188 1.743-.14a4.5 4.5 0 004.486-6.336l-3.276 3.277a3.004 3.004 0 01-2.25-2.25l3.276-3.276a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.336 4.486c.091 1.076-.071 2.264-.904 2.95l-.102.085m-1.745 1.437L5.909 7.5H4.5L2.25 3.75l1.5-1.5L7.5 4.5v1.409l4.26 4.26m-1.745 1.437l1.745-1.437m6.615 8.206L15.75 15.75M4.867 19.125h.008v.008h-.008v-.008z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Broken Key in Car Door</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            A key that snaps inside the car door lock creates a lockout that cannot be resolved simply by opening the door — the fragment must be removed before any key will work again. Attempting to pull a broken key out with pliers or tweezers risks pushing it deeper or scratching the cylinder.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Our technicians carry dedicated <a href="/services/broken-key-extraction/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">broken key extraction</a> tools — hook picks and spiral extractors designed specifically for automotive lock cylinders — that grip the key fragment and draw it out cleanly without cylinder damage.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Once the fragment is removed, the cylinder typically functions normally. We assess the lock's condition on the spot and can cut a new key immediately so you are back on the road without delay.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 5.25a3 3 0 013 3m3 0a6 6 0 01-7.029 5.912c-.563-.097-1.159.026-1.563.43L10.5 17.25H8.25v2.25H6v2.25H2.25v-2.818c0-.597.237-1.17.659-1.591l6.499-6.499c.404-.404.527-1 .43-1.563A6 6 0 1121.75 8.25z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Trunk Lockout</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Keys in the trunk with the lid shut? This is a surprisingly common situation — especially when loading groceries or luggage — and it requires a different approach than a standard door lockout. Most modern vehicles have a trunk release lever inside the passenger compartment, which is accessible once we open a door.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We open the car door first using our standard automotive entry tools, then access the interior trunk release to retrieve your keys. For vehicles with a separate trunk cylinder, we can pick the trunk lock directly if needed.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            If the keys inside the trunk are your only set, we recommend getting a <a href="/services/car-key-replacement/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">spare key made</a> on the same visit — a simple precaution that eliminates this problem in the future.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.594 3.94c.09-.542.56-.94 1.11-.94h2.593c.55 0 1.02.398 1.11.94l.213 1.281c.063.374.313.686.645.87.074.04.147.083.22.127.324.196.72.257 1.075.124l1.217-.456a1.125 1.125 0 011.37.49l1.296 2.247a1.125 1.125 0 01-.26 1.431l-1.003.827c-.293.24-.438.613-.431.992a6.759 6.759 0 010 .255c-.007.378.138.75.43.99l1.005.828c.424.35.534.954.26 1.43l-1.298 2.247a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.369.491l-1.217-.456c-.355-.133-.75-.072-1.076.124a6.57 6.57 0 01-.22.128c-.331.183-.581.495-.644.869l-.213 1.28c-.09.543-.56.941-1.11.941h-2.594c-.55 0-1.02-.398-1.11-.94l-.213-1.281c-.062-.374-.312-.686-.644-.87a6.52 6.52 0 01-.22-.127c-.325-.196-.72-.257-1.076-.124l-1.217.456a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.369-.49l-1.297-2.247a1.125 1.125 0 01.26-1.431l1.004-.827c.292-.24.437-.613.43-.992a6.932 6.932 0 010-.255c.007-.378-.138-.75-.43-.99l-1.004-.828a1.125 1.125 0 01-.26-1.43l1.297-2.247a1.125 1.125 0 011.37-.491l1.216.456c.356.133.751.072 1.076-.124.072-.044.146-.087.22-.128.332-.183.582-.495.644-.869l.214-1.281z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Key Fob & Remote Entry Failure</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Many drivers rely entirely on their key fob for vehicle entry and forget — or don't know — that their key fob often contains a physical blade key for emergencies. When the fob battery dies, the remote entry stops working, and if you've lost the habit of using the physical key slot, it can feel like a lockout even when it isn't.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We assess the situation on arrival — whether the fob battery simply needs replacing, whether there is an electronic issue with the fob itself, or whether <a href="/services/key-fob-programming/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">key fob programming</a> or replacement is needed. We carry fob batteries and can often resolve the problem on the spot.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            For fobs that are damaged, lost, or paired to the wrong vehicle profile, we offer full key fob replacement and programming services for many makes and models at rates significantly below dealership prices.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 5 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126zM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Keys Locked Inside with Engine Running</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
